<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">kinetic-hurl</ansi> spell

The <ansi fg="command">Kinetic Hurl</ansi> spell propels a focused bolt of telekinetic force at
a single target with sharp precision. It is among the most accessible
offensive spells — low conviction cost, quick to fold, and reliable
for casters at any stage of their development.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">cast kinetic-hurl [target]</ansi>

<ansi fg="yellow">Details: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Type:        </ansi> Harm Single
  <ansi fg="yellow">School:      </ansi> Elemental
  <ansi fg="yellow">Base Folds:  </ansi> 4
  <ansi fg="yellow">Conv. Cost:  </ansi> 15
  <ansi fg="yellow">Defense:     </ansi> Physical — quick reflexes can dodge it; armor only
                 softens what lands
  <ansi fg="yellow">Effect:      </ansi> Direct damage to a single target

